sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer
    participant MA as Mini App
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant P as Acquirer
    participant L as Ledger

    C->>MA: amount + method
    MA->>API: POST /wallet/topup
    API->>API: reject wallet, 1:1 amount, currency from provider
    API->>API: orders(purpose=wallet_topup)
    API->>P: create_intent
    API-->>MA: PaymentOut
    MA->>P: hosted pay page
    P->>API: settle_provider_payment
    API->>L: D user_wallet / C provider_clearing
    API->>API: order delivered (no fulfilment)
    API-->>MA: GET /orders/{id} status=delivered
